#
# This file contains network name/network number mappings for
# local networks. Network numbers are recognized in dotted decimal form.
#
# Format:
#
# <network name>  <network number>     [aliases...]  [#<comment>]
#
# For example:
#
#    loopback     127
#    campus       284.122.107
