␀␀␀../modules/rosapps/applications/explorer-old/utility/shellclasses.h␀-␀?␀␀␀␀␀ROS Explorer - command line options␀/e        open cabinet window in explorer mode
/root        open cabinet window in rooted mode
/mdi        open cabinet window in MDI mode
/sdi        open cabinet window in SDI mode

-?        display command line options

-desktop        start in desktop mode regardless of an already running shell
-nodesktop    disable desktop mode
-explorer        display cabinet window regardless of enabled desktop mode

-install        replace previous shell application with ROS Explorer

-noautostart    disable autostarts
-autostart    enable autostarts regardless of debug build

-console        open debug console

-debug        activate GDB remote debugging stub
-break        activate debugger breakpoint
